                    <p style="margin-bottom:12px;">If you want to continue, please approach your team lead or respective administrators for further action.</p>
                    <p style="margin-bottom:12px;">Need help? Contact <a href="mailto:adityasahu.dev@gmail.com">adityasahu.dev@gmail.com</a> or visit <a href="https://adityatechndevoops.web.app/contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener">support contact</a>.</p>
